<h1>Alexi Giannoulias</h1>
<p>Secretary of State, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.alexiforus.com" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (alexiforus.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Running for a second term on his record of modernizing the office, including the Skip the Line DMV appointment system, DMV kiosks in grocery stores, and a mobile DMV unit. He also cites legislation he backed against book banning in libraries, limits on using license plate data to track women seeking abortions across state lines, and easing license renewal requirements for older drivers.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Illinois state treasurer from 2007 to 2011, the youngest person elected to that office; secretary of state since 2023.</p>
